sentences.text:
Instead of making an award in consonance with the directions of the Revenue Minister, it seems that the file was again put up before the Revenue Minister, who, vide his note dated 26.11.1999,
while clearly observing that there should have been no change to his earlier decision regarding fixation of rate of Rs. 3.00 lacs per kanal, has also observed that he feels that he should, in principle,
accept the recommendation made by Tehsildar at the initial stage, who had proposed rate of Rs.2.00 lacs per kanal.
